msgid "Create"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/incoming-webhooks.rst:33
msgid ""
"In Mattermost, go to **Product Menu > Integrations**. If you don't have "
"the **Integrations** option, incoming webhooks may not be enabled on your"
" Mattermost server or may be disabled for non-admins. A System Admin can "
"enable them from **System Console > Integrations > Integration "
"Management**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/incoming-webhooks.rst:35
msgid "Mattermost menu options showing the ability to work with integrations."
